    <title>Tou#73 对话金牌音乐制作人龙隆：唠点音乐与体育的灵魂共振</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/682630eb1ced30a2318c462c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">682630eb1ced30a2318c462c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 15 May 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>龙老师金牌音乐制作人，他更热爱体育；</span></p><span></span><p><span>濛主奥运冠军，她出了一首单曲；</span></p><span></span><p><span>他理解音乐的真谛，她滑出短道的峰值；</span></p><span></span><p><span>你想象的两个不同领域的佼佼者是咋唠嗑的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>濛主说要当主唱，龙老师说唱功有待提高......更多有趣内容尽在本期播客，他们通过对音乐、对短道的极度认知与理解，诠释了他们对人生，对事物的看法，你能共振到多少呢，欢迎收听本期播客~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 《向未来奔跑》幕后制作人出现了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a> 演出跟高铁打不了一点招呼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a> 音乐人对体育的理解达到了顶峰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> 音乐还可以提升肾上腺素？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1878">31:18</a> 濛主与音乐节隔着几首歌的距离？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2226">37:06</a> 音乐要有态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2911">48:31</a> 下面进入闲聊音乐与AI科学的环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4439">01:13:59</a> 龙老师对周教授唱功评价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4605">01:16:45</a> 东北是最早接受西方古典音乐的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4770">01:19:30</a> 濛主现场要歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播&amp;嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：浣熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：濛主@王濛；龙老师@龙隆</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家扫码或者搜索微信号:xiaozhulitoutou（“小助理透透”全拼）联系小助理加入听友群，我们敞开了聊~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqI9rGbVVBtYeUWuiQ5zo91KU66E.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
