    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>五一旅游高峰说来就来了，国内、国外有哪些不同体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span>“有人”在国外被牛排“安排”的明明白白；</span></p><span></span><p><span>“有人”游学途中神操作，成功帮忙开启“穷学”生活；</span></p><span></span><p><span>“有人”还被告知她家中了一套房，就因为报了个旅游团儿；</span></p><span></span><p><span>“有人”还在旅途中见证了别人的“悲欢离合”</span></p><span></span><p><span>想知道这人儿的故事吗？赶快来听听，该借鉴的借鉴，该避雷的避雷！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a>西藏之旅“后遗症”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a> 这些年的外国印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1039">17:19</a> 你有没有“中国胃”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">24:18</a> 中国人是世界的“扎基拉姆”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1659">27:39</a> 身边人遇到的那些旅游陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2308">38:28</a> 多年前被迫“穷学”生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4092">01:08:12</a> 没有一件大事儿能逃过爸爸们的关心</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播&amp;嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：浣熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：濛主@王濛；</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家扫码或者搜索微信号:xiaozhulitoutou（“小助理透透”全拼）联系小助理加入听友群，我们敞开了聊~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqI9rGbVVBtYeUWuiQ5zo91KU66E.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
